("I never took Hindi classes growing up. But somehow I understand it, because of Nani. Every video call, she) Tj
T* (mixes Hindi and English, and I just... know. She'd tell me stories and I'd ask, 'Nani, what does that word) Tj
T* (mean?' She'd explain, then test me the next week. Now when I visit India, people are surprised—'Your Hindi) Tj
T* (is so good!' I tell them, 'I learned it from love stories and cooking instructions.'") Tj
