("Dad taught me saxophone when I was eight. He was a session musician—never famous, but he played with) Tj
T* (legends. The night before he passed, he couldn't speak anymore, but he held my hand and hummed the) Tj
T* (melody of 'My Favorite Things.' I sat with him until morning, humming along. Now I play it at the end of) Tj
T* (every concert. No one knows why. It's just for him and me.") Tj
